    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runemon</strong> is a 1-3 player creature-collecting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY-DRIVEN ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your backpack and begin your journey through the world of Runemon as a novice monster tamer. Catch new Runemon, battle other adventurers, and stop the Shadow Brotherhood's evil plans to rule Runeterra, the world of Runemon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATURE COLLECTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through diverse environments, you will encounter various types of Runemon. You may even discover one of the ancient Runemon rumored to dwell in the unexplored parts of Runeterra. Are you up to the challenge of catching every Runemon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSATILE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an effective squad by training your Runemon for specific roles such as attacker, tank, healer, or support. Showcase the strength of your Runemon squad in a turn-based 3-vs-3 battle where every buff, debuff, condition and environment matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CAMPAIGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your friends at any time and face Runeterra's challenges together. Explore the world, complete quests, and battle your rivals alongside your friends. You can also challenge your friends to a battle to find out who is the best Runemon tamer in your team.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runemon</strong> is a 1-3 player creature-collecting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY-DRIVEN ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your backpack and begin your journey through the world of Runemon as a novice monster tamer. Catch new Runemon, battle other adventurers, and stop the Shadow Brotherhood's evil plans to rule Runeterra, the world of Runemon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATURE COLLECTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through diverse environments, you will encounter various types of Runemon. You may even discover one of the ancient Runemon rumored to dwell in the unexplored parts of Runeterra. Are you up to the challenge of catching every Runemon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSATILE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an effective squad by training your Runemon for specific roles such as attacker, tank, healer, or support. Showcase the strength of your Runemon squad in a turn-based 3-vs-3 battle where every buff, debuff, condition and environment matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CAMPAIGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your friends at any time and face Runeterra's challenges together. Explore the world, complete quests, and battle your rivals alongside your friends. You can also challenge your friends to a battle to find out who is the best Runemon tamer in your team.</p>",
    "short_description": "Runemon is a 1-3 player monster-taming game. Start an epic adventure with your friends, catch all the Runemon in the world, build a powerful squad and defeat your rivals in turn-based combat.",
